2. Full-suite comparison exactly as the plan's Verification specifies: `go test ./... -count=1 -json` into `work/w2_stale-race/artifacts/post4.json` (with its stderr and status files), the existing `work/w2_stale-race/artifacts/normalize_failures.py` → `work/w2_stale-race/artifacts/post4_failures.txt`, then `comm -13 work/w2_stale-race/artifacts/baseline_failures.txt work/w2_stale-race/artifacts/post4_failures.txt` must print nothing.
